    "innovation": "This paper shows that the collapse of the Barents-Kara Ice Sheet was caused by a marine ice-sheet instability triggered by atmospheric warming, challenging the prevailing view that such instabilities are initiated by ocean-induced melting.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
        {
