            "relation": "USES_PHYSICAL_SCHEME",
            "target_entity_instance": "positive degree day (PDD) method for ablation",
            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalScheme",
            "paragraph": "Ablation is calculated using a positive degree day (PDD) method, as formulated by Tarasov and Peltier (2002). Snow accumulation is computed from the total precipitation, interpolated on the GRISLI grid, for months with average temperatures below the melting point.",
